  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mpui Maize Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Maize, Beneficiaries: 553 smallholder farmers, This is a maize value chain project being implemented by Mpui maize farmers cooperative trading as Mpui SACCOS. The organization is seeking for a capacity building grant to enhance its capability to produce high quality white maize for existing orders with large buyers and processors. through this value chain, maize production and productivity will be enhanced by adopting GAP and availability of inputs through a revolving facility. The expected high impacts on more than 1200 beneficiaries will be reflected through higher incomes and livelihoods and acquired new skills in maize production and productivity.</narrative>
  </description>
